      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are two draft options depending on the level of directness you prefer.\n\n**Option 1 (Gentle):** \"We couldn't complete your transfer at this time because the available balance is insufficient for this amount. Please review your account details or try a smaller transfer when you're ready.\"\n\n**Option 2 (Direct & Actionable):** \"Your large wire transfer failed due to insufficient funds. To proceed, please add more funds to your account or adjust the transfer amount.\"",
