      "content": "thanks for those. they're okay, but they feel a bit dry. looking at the sentiment score for those options, they're landing pretty low—like, basically neutral. \n\nsince the brand research shows users feel a lot of anxiety during failed transfers, i really want to push that positivity score up a bit more. don't go overboard or get \"bubbly\" like i said before, but can you try to refine these so they feel more \"uplifting\" or encouraging? just try to bump that positivity metric up a few points while still being professional.",
